   <h2>Presiding Judge Orders<br></h2>The 
   <a href="https&#58;//cdm17027.contentdm.oclc.org/digital/collection/p17027coll15/search">Presiding Judge Orders</a> assign actions and proceedings pending before a court to other judges of the judicial district for hearing and disposition.<br>
   <h2>Chief Justice Order (CJO 25-018)<br></h2> The 
   <a href="/rules/Documents/CJO_2025-018.pdf">Chief Justice Order</a> establishes interim procedures addressing immigration enforcement activities in the Oregon courts on 7/1/25. 
