   <i class="fa fa-newspaper" aria-hidden="true">​​​​​​</i>&#160;&#160;Latest News<br></h3><p>
   <span data-teams="true">Please visit our newsroom for the latest news and stories about Oregon's courts.</span>​<br></p> 
<a role="button" href="https&#58;//apps.oregon.gov/oregon-newsroom/OR/OJD/Posts" class="btn btn-lg btn-primary" target="_blank" style="color&#58;#ffffff;">Go to the Newsroom</a>​ 
